WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:11.609
One day Dirk rang the bell.

2
00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:22.727
"Servants and knights to the Royal Ballroom!" he yelled.

3
00:00:22.728 --> 00:00:27.221
"Something is wrong," Tom thought.

4
00:00:27.222 --> 00:00:33.579
He followed everyone to the ballroom.

5
00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:40.788
The king paced up and down.

6
00:00:40.789 --> 00:00:45.602
"A dragon is approaching the palace," he said.

7
00:00:45.603 --> 00:00:47.866
"And it breathes fire!"

8
00:00:47.867 --> 00:00:54.236
Everyone gasped. "Fire?"

9
00:00:54.237 --> 00:00:58.364
"Knights, climb to the highest towers," the king ordered.

10
00:00:58.365 --> 00:01:01.885
"Get ready to throw your swords at the dragon."

11
00:01:01.886 --> 00:01:03.747
"Yes, Your Majesty!"

12
00:01:03.748 --> 00:01:10.956
The knights hurried off.

13
00:01:10.957 --> 00:01:15.411
"Servants, gather some boulders," the king said.

14
00:01:15.412 --> 00:01:18.285
"Get ready to throw them at the dragon."

15
00:01:18.286 --> 00:01:20.060
"Yes, Your Majesty!"

16
00:01:20.061 --> 00:01:21.972
The servants hurried off.

17
00:01:21.973 --> 00:01:27.060
Then the king rushed away too.

18
00:01:27.061 --> 00:01:28.741
Tom looked at Dirk.

19
00:01:28.742 --> 00:01:30.915
"Should I do a spell?"

20
00:01:30.916 --> 00:01:33.699
"No!" Dirk scowled.

21
00:01:33.700 --> 00:01:37.391
"This is a serious problem, Wizard.

22
00:01:37.392 --> 00:01:45.703
Just stay here—out of everyone's way!"

23
00:01:45.704 --> 00:01:50.749
Dirk left the ballroom.

24
00:01:50.750 --> 00:01:54.526
Tom was mad.

25
00:01:54.527 --> 00:01:58.336
He kicked the wall hard.

26
00:01:58.337 --> 00:02:01.875
"Ouch! My foot!" Tom cried.

27
00:02:01.876 --> 00:02:08.524
A tapestry fell off the wall and hit Tom.

28
00:02:08.525 --> 00:02:12.056
Cat jumped out of his pocket.

29
00:02:12.057 --> 00:02:15.801
"Are you okay?" she asked.

30
00:02:15.802 --> 00:02:18.547
"Yes." Tom nodded.

31
00:02:18.548 --> 00:02:22.070
"But I'm the royal wizard.

32
00:02:22.071 --> 00:02:26.638
I want to help with the dragon."

33
00:02:26.639 --> 00:02:30.045
"Then go help," Cat said.

34
00:02:30.046 --> 00:02:32.242
Tom shook his head.

35
00:02:32.243 --> 00:02:34.981
"Dirk said to stay—"

36
00:02:34.982 --> 00:02:37.926
A door flew open.

37
00:02:37.927 --> 00:02:50.189
Then Dirk stormed back inside.

